/target
in*.pdf
out*.pdf
*.docx.pdf
*test*.pdf
# bugs/ fixtures are never gitignored (~/.claude/rules/bug-reports.md) — the
# scratch-PDF patterns above would otherwise silently swallow files like
# bugs/bug-0001/input-4page.pdf.
!bugs/**
# ...except build output from a repro crate, the one ignore the rule permits there.
bugs/**/target/
.cargo/config.toml
.claude/settings.local.json
.publish-bin.toml
.install-bin.toml
